**/.circleci
**/.editorconfig
**/.dockerignore
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/node_modules

# Specific patterns to ignore
data-node
meili_data*
# Upstream ignores every `librechat*` path so a developer's personal config and
# API keys never bake into an image. This fork's config is shipped inside the
# image on purpose (deploy-compose.yml also bind-mounts over it), and it contains
# no secrets, so re-include exactly that one file.
librechat*
!librechat.pure-doctor.yaml
Dockerfile*
docs

# Ignore all hidden files
.*

# raw disease dataset (the image only needs the built index)
packages/mcp-medical/data/disease-kb/source
